One may manually compile and link the example together 
thus : 

$ $CC $CFLAGS -I/opt/bw/include $CPPFLAGS -c -o gmp_mpfr_ver.o gmp_mpfr_ver.c
$ $CC $CFLAGS -I/opt/bw/include $CPPFLAGS -c -o mpfr.o mpfr.c
$ $CC $CFLAGS $CPPFLAGS -c -o timediff.o ../time_and_date/timediff.c 
$ $CC $CFLAGS $CPPFLAGS -L/opt/bw/lib -o mpfr mpfr.o gmp_mpfr_ver.o timediff.o -lgmp -lmpfr -lm 

be sure to set -D_XOPEN_SOURCE=500 on an old old Solaris machine
also you will likely need -lrt there
